OL,3,GNEWSACowboy builder tore my home apart
OL,4,Aand disappeared off the face of the
OL,5,AEarth with #14k
OL,6,
OL,7,FA rogue builder tore Sheri Ingram's
OL,8,Fhome apart and "disappeared off the
OL,9,Fface of the Earth" with #14,000.
OL,11,FIn February, Lee Slocombe, from
OL,12,FSwansea, was jailed for six years after
OL,13,Fdefrauding nine victims of #400,000 -
OL,14,Fwith this his latest conviction in a
OL,15,Fdecade of offending.
OL,17,FThe UK government announced in August
OL,18,Fplans to give people greater
OL,19,Fprotections against "cowboy builders"
OL,20,Fthrough a database of trusted traders.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
